Рисунок 2. (MainWindow.xaml)

2.2 Проектирование базы данных
Сущности:
Users: UserID, Username, Password, Role;
Clients: ClientID, Name, Contact;
Services: ServiceID, ServiceName, Price;
Orders: OrderID, ClientID, ServiceID, OrderDate, CompletionDate, Status, Notes.
Связи:
Clients – Orders (1:N)
Services – Orders (1:N)
